資料授權說明 / Data licence note

程式碼（`app/`、`scripts/`）依 MIT 授權。
Code in `app/` and `scripts/` is licensed under MIT.

本專案產生的衍生資料（`app/src/data/works.json` 的分數與編輯註記）以
CC BY 4.0 釋出，請標註「Breakout 破圈資料集 v0.1」與資料快照日。
Derived data produced by this project (scores and editorial notes in
`app/src/data/works.json`) is released under CC BY 4.0. Please credit
"Breakout dataset v0.1" with the snapshot date.

原始資料（AniList 的評分、人氣、收藏、趨勢）著作權屬 AniList 與其貢獻者，
本專案僅按公開 API 條款存取；正式商業使用前請自行確認授權。
Upstream data (AniList scores, popularity, favourites, trend) remains the
property of AniList and its contributors. This project only accesses it via the
public API; verify the terms before any commercial use.
